Value Filldown ROUTER_ID (\S+)
Value Filldown LOCAL_AS (\d+)
Value Required PEER (\S+)
Value PEER_AS (\d+)
Value UP_DOWN (\S+)
Value PREFIXES_RECEIVED (\d+)
Value STATE (\D\S*(?: \(\S+\))?)

# One record per BGP peer, for the IPv4 unicast, VPNv4 and L2VPN EVPN summaries (campus-wan
# and vpn-fabric labs, IOS-XE 17). The last column is the received-prefix count once the
# session is established, else the session state.
Start
  ^BGP router identifier ${ROUTER_ID}, local AS number ${LOCAL_AS}\s*$$
  ^BGP table version is \d+, main routing table version \d+\s*$$
  ^\d+ (network|path) entries using \d+ bytes of memory\s*$$
  ^\d+/\d+ BGP path/bestpath attribute entries using \d+ bytes of memory\s*$$
  ^\d+ BGP [\w -]+ entries using \d+ bytes of memory\s*$$
  ^BGP using \d+ total bytes of memory\s*$$
  ^BGP activity .*$$
  ^\d+ networks peaked at .*$$
  ^Neighbor\s+V\s+AS\s+MsgRcvd\s+MsgSent\s+TblVer\s+InQ\s+OutQ\s+Up/Down\s+State/PfxRcd\s*$$ -> Peers
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized BGP summary line"

Peers
  ^${PEER}\s+4\s+${PEER_AS}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${UP_DOWN}\s+${PREFIXES_RECEIVED}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${PEER}\s+4\s+${PEER_AS}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${UP_DOWN}\s+${STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized BGP neighbor row"
